[manpage_begin tufuzzy n 0.1]
[moddesc {tclutils}]
[titledesc {Fuzzy matching primitives}]
[require Tcl 8.6]
[require tclutils::tufuzzy 0.1]
[description]
[para]The [package tclutils::tufuzzy] package provides edit-distance based fuzzy matching primitives.
[section COMMANDS]
[list_begin definitions]
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tufuzzy::distance] [arg a] [arg b]]
Returns the Levenshtein distance.
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tufuzzy::searchDistance] [arg pattern] [arg text]]
Returns the minimum distance to a substring of text.
[list_end]
[manpage_end]
